# Agent skills installed at project scope with `npx skills add <repo>`. A full
# install is ~21 MB and mostly unrelated vendor material (GKE, BigQuery, Ads),
# so it stays local and is reinstalled on demand. Only the workflow skills that
# apply to this codebase are committed.
